{% block content %}
<main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero compact-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Trust and Accessibility</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>How Athanas Inspires handles information and website technologies</p></section><section class="legal-shell"><article class="legal-card">
<p class="legal-note"><strong>Last updated: 15 July 2026.</strong> This policy explains the current website setup. It is general information and is not a substitute for legal advice.</p>
<h2>Information visitors choose to provide</h2><p>Athanas Inspires may receive information when a visitor sends an email, starts a WhatsApp conversation, submits an assignment, or contacts the platform directly. Please avoid sending sensitive personal information unless it is necessary for the support you requested.</p>
<h2>Website analytics</h2><p>Optional Google Analytics measurements may be used to understand which pages, lessons, downloads, and tools are useful. Analytics storage remains disabled until a visitor chooses “Accept Analytics” in the website privacy choices. Visitors can continue using essential website features without accepting analytics.</p>
<h2>Embedded and external services</h2><p>The website links to or embeds services such as YouTube and WhatsApp. Opening or playing content from those services may allow the service provider to process information under its own privacy practices. External links open only when the visitor chooses them.</p>
<h2>Browser storage</h2><p>Essential local or session storage may remember choices such as dismissed welcome audio, testimonial autoplay preference, cookie choice, and an Assistant conversation saved on the visitor’s device. This information is not automatically sent to Athanas Inspires.</p>
<h2>Downloads and assignments</h2><p>Files are provided for learning and practice. Assignment submissions sent through WhatsApp are handled as direct messages between the learner and Athanas Inspires.</p>
<h2>Children and education use</h2><p>Children should use the website with appropriate guidance from a parent, guardian, or teacher. Do not submit a child’s personal information publicly.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about privacy can be sent to <a href="mailto:chriss.ath2@gmail.com">chriss.ath2@gmail.com</a> or through the contact page.</p></article></section></main>
{% endblock %}

